+- `lines` counts nonblank lines, including tag lines.
+  Blank lines and lines with only spaces or other whitespace do not contribute to the count.
+- Tags are lines that begin with `#`.
+  The `tags` list contains the text after `#`, with surrounding whitespace removed.
